{"id":"eb44d9c28d5a7f27","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-zfc-ideal7-antichain-ideal.md","title":"ZFC Ideal7 Antichain Ideal","display":"df-zfc-ideal7-antichain-ideal — ZFC Ideal7 Antichain Ideal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-ideal7-antichain-ideal","aliases":["58-df-zfc-ideal7-antichain-ideal"],"display":"df-zfc-ideal7-antichain-ideal — ZFC Ideal7 Antichain Ideal","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-ideal7-antichain-ideal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-ideal7-antichain-ideal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-ideal7-antichain-ideal — ZFC Ideal7 Antichain Ideal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(P,R)\">\\((P,R)\\)</span> (poset)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq P\">\\(A\\subseteq P\\)</span> (candidate antichain)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I\\subseteq\\mathcal P(P)\">\\(\\mathcal I\\subseteq\\mathcal P(P)\\)</span> (candidate ideal)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}\\)</span> (poset predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OrderAntichain}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{OrderAntichain}_S\\)</span> (order-antichain predicate defined below)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AntichainIdeal}\">\\(\\operatorname{AntichainIdeal}\\)</span> (predicate defined below)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal7\\text{-}order\\text{-}antichain} \\vdash \\operatorname{OrderAntichain}_S(A,P,R)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Poset}(P,R)\\land A\\subseteq P\\land\\forall a,b\\in A\\;\\bigl(a\\neq b\\to(\\langle a,b\\rangle\\notin R\\land\\langle b,a\\rangle\\notin R)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal7\\text{-}order\\text{-}antichain} \\vdash \\operatorname{OrderAntichain}_S(A,P,R)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Poset}(P,R)\\land A\\subseteq P\\land\\forall a,b\\in A\\;\\bigl(a\\neq b\\to(\\langle a,b\\rangle\\notin R\\land\\langle b,a\\rangle\\notin R)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal7\\text{-}antichain\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash \\operatorname{AntichainIdeal}(\\mathcal I,P,R)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Poset}(P,R)\\land\\mathcal I=\\left\\{X\\subseteq P:\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists f\\in\\mathcal P(P)^n\\;\\left((\\forall k&lt;n\\;\\operatorname{OrderAntichain}_S(f(k),P,R))\\land X\\subseteq\\bigcup_{k&lt;n}f(k)\\right)\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal7\\text{-}antichain\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash \\operatorname{AntichainIdeal}(\\mathcal I,P,R)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Poset}(P,R)\\land\\mathcal I=\\left\\{X\\subseteq P:\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists f\\in\\mathcal P(P)^n\\;\\left((\\forall k&lt;n\\;\\operatorname{OrderAntichain}_S(f(k),P,R))\\land X\\subseteq\\bigcup_{k&lt;n}f(k)\\right)\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The collection of individual antichains is not generally closed under unions. The definition therefore takes the ideal generated by antichains, namely subsets covered by finitely many antichains.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Poset}$ (poset predicate, see [[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(P,R)","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal I\\subseteq\\mathcal P(P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Poset}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{OrderAntichain}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{AntichainIdeal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal7\\text{-}order\\text{-}antichain} \\vdash \\operatorname{OrderAntichain}_S(A,P,R)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Poset}(P,R)\\land A\\subseteq P\\land\\forall a,b\\in A\\;\\bigl(a\\neq b\\to(\\langle a,b\\rangle\\notin R\\land\\langle b,a\\rangle\\notin R)\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal7\\text{-}antichain\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash \\operatorname{AntichainIdeal}(\\mathcal I,P,R)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Poset}(P,R)\\land\\mathcal I=\\left\\{X\\subseteq P:\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists f\\in\\mathcal P(P)^n\\;\\left((\\forall k<n\\;\\operatorname{OrderAntichain}_S(f(k),P,R))\\land X\\subseteq\\bigcup_{k<n}f(k)\\right)\\right\\}","display":true}],"bytes":1527,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2298","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-ideal7-antichain-ideal.md|58-df-zfc-ideal7-antichain-ideal]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["d3f859dbdd37f018"]}